            "code": "# Confusion matrix produced by sklearn's\n# confusion_matrix(y_true, y_pred) for classes [0, 1].\n# sklearn convention:\n#   rows    = TRUE label\n#   columns = PREDICTED label\n#\n#                 pred 0   pred 1\n#   true 0     [    40       10   ]\n#   true 1     [     5       45   ]\n\ncm = [[40, 10],\n      [ 5, 45]]",
